          "chunk_id": "s01_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c2_layer_6_published_iclr_2025",
          "text": "This paper, from Layer 6 AI and published at ICLR 2025, proposes the manifold memorization hypothesis: a geometric framework that reasons about memorization through the local intrinsic dimension of the data and model manifolds.",
          "expected_role": "guidance",
          "cue_keywords": [
