          "chunk_index": 3,
          "chunk_id": "s01_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c3_provides_formal_standard_how_memoriz",
          "text": "It provides a formal standard for how memorized a datapoint is, cleanly separates memorization caused by overfitting from memorization caused by the data itself, and yields scalable tools to detect and mitigate memorization all the way up to Stable Diffusion.",
