        {
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "chunk_id": "s02_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c1_generative_models_diffusion_models_p",
          "text": "Generative models, and diffusion models in particular, are increasingly deployed in public-facing applications, but with enough capacity they memorize training data.",
